      "Text": "啊"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100920150,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ㅡ ㅡ;;;"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100920160,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "別鬧了啦，真是的"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100920170,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 1,
      "Text": "我會把地點拍給你，就在那裡見吧"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100920180,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "總覺得"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100920190,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "那個"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100920200,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "好像欠了很大的人情"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100920210,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "本來沒打算這樣的"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100920220,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "別在意，我是喜歡才那麼做的"
    },
    {
